From c15e16d1ec7afc62c6800e2e01725c7b70ca772f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:44:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 095/118] test(pypto-x): truthful execution modes, liveness A/B
 and per-layer debug bisect in the weighted driver

- OpRecorder/InstrumentedAvx512Runtime now classify every operation from
  Avx512Runtime.plan_execution instead of a static name table, so packed
  native kernels are reported truthfully and the list-materialization guard
  still fires on any real host-reference fallback.
- S1 records per-output digests so a liveness on/off A/B can be compared
  bit-for-bit.
- --disable-liveness-release, --debug-hidden-states, --debug-extra-returns,
  --debug-dump and --debug-decay-exp-a-log add debug-only observability; the
  public 51-return binding contract is unchanged.
